# Cloudflare serves these with every file under public/ (the demo page and
# the package files the build copies into vendor/). The page loads nothing
# from another origin and writes every answer with textContent; these stop
# it being framed or sniffed. No script-src policy: the page's import map
# and module script are inline, and its WebAssembly needs compiling.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
